00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:36,640
relative speeds of the wave in the first

554
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:41,080
and second medium. This explains a lot

555
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:41,080
of wave phenomena. Very cool.

556
00:20:41,280 --> 00:20:45,200
Now let's look at this example. An

557
00:20:43,120 --> 00:20:47,679
ultrasonic transducer array shown here

