586
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:48,159
This is how we visualize and control

587
00:21:46,320 --> 00:21:51,799
wave propagation in a precise

588
00:21:48,159 --> 00:21:51,799
programmable way.

589
00:21:53,039 --> 00:21:57,360
Let me make this clearer using a linear

590
00:21:55,039 --> 00:21:59,120
phased array example. If you fire all

591
00:21:57,360 --> 00:22:01,120
