670
00:24:52,559 --> 00:24:56,880
So you can adjust the focal distance to

671
00:24:54,559 --> 00:24:58,960
be small or large. That's something you

672
00:24:56,880 --> 00:25:01,960
can easily do with this annular array

673
00:24:58,960 --> 00:25:01,960
structure.

674
00:25:03,279 --> 00:25:07,679
