1122
00:41:12,560 --> 00:41:15,920
both sending and receiving providing

1123
00:41:14,400 --> 00:41:20,119
constant velocity measurement but

1124
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:20,119
without specific depth localization.

1125
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:25,599
Now let's take a closer look at what

1126
00:41:23,599 --> 00:41:27,599
actually happens to the signal. You have

1127
00:41:25,599 --> 00:41:29,599
