1176
00:43:16,800 --> 00:43:21,520
entire beam path. So continuous wave

1177
00:43:19,359 --> 00:43:25,160
Doppler gives accurate velocity data but

1178
00:43:21,520 --> 00:43:25,160
without depth resolution.

1179
00:43:26,640 --> 00:43:31,040
