1192
00:43:55,359 --> 00:43:58,800
travels into the tissue, reflects from

1193
00:43:57,280 --> 00:44:01,119
structures, and returns to the

1194
00:43:58,800 --> 00:44:03,040
transducer. The process repeats again

1195
00:44:01,119 --> 00:44:04,880
and again, one pulse at a time, to

1196
00:44:03,040 --> 00:44:08,760
measure motion and flow at specific

1197
00:44:04,880 --> 00:44:08,760
depths within the body.

1198
00:44:10,079 --> 00:44:14,079
Now, I've included here two images from

1199
00:44:12,240 --> 00:44:16,400
another textbook that show this more

1200
00:44:14,079 --> 00:44:18,319
graphically. You can see how the pulses

1201
00:44:16,400 --> 00:44:20,640
are sent one after another into the

1202
00:44:18,319 --> 00:44:22,319
biological tissue.

1203
00:44:20,640 --> 00:44:24,640
