1271
00:46:51,839 --> 00:46:56,480
which reflects the motion or velocity of

1272
00:46:54,079 --> 00:46:58,400
the surface or fluid.

1273
00:46:56,480 --> 00:47:01,119
Usually the motion is not perfectly

1274
00:46:58,400 --> 00:47:03,440
uniform but has some periodic pattern.

1275
00:47:01,119 --> 00:47:07,440
By analyzing these Doppler frequencies,

1276
00:47:03,440 --> 00:47:09,680
we can quantify that motion precisely.

1277
00:47:07,440 --> 00:47:12,079
So this is the basic idea behind pulseed

1278
00:47:09,680 --> 00:47:14,079
wave Doppler. It's slightly more complex

1279
00:47:12,079 --> 00:47:16,160
than continuous wave Doppler, but it has

